    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >``Spring Adventure'' is a game where you work together to progress through the stages. It is an adventure game where you advance through the stages by avoiding or defeating various traps and monsters. There are various weapons and tools available, so please share your roles and progress through the stages in cooperation or solo. If you are trying to play solo, it will be quite difficult, so we recommend making friends to play with before trying. Well, if you're still going solo, please at least try to clear the stage while cooperating with your own spirit.</p>",
